  "verified": [
    "The native status-only call and output call share the same polling implementation.",
    "An active blocked decoder reports Busy and clears the output.",
    "Old ticket generations cannot return a later same-name publication.",
    "A widget destructor removing the new entry at the poll tail yields a null output; the old source returns a stale pointer.",
