    "xlang adopts the optional watched Context resource through the original native output path.",
    "View-admission OOM is retryable. Request closure leaves a published resource live.",
    "Name replacement expires the previous view. An independently retained Surface survives resource removal.",
    "Malformed image data fails with native status and produces no registry entry.",
    "Windows and Linux run memory and local file decode in JIT and both AOT link modes.",
    "The beginner example displays the decoded image on the real backend."
